{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombies &amp; Bullets</strong> is a 3D top-down action shooter game where you must help the soldier Jacob face armies of zombies in diverse and challenging environments. Prove your skills and reflexes and become the warrior of the zombie apocalypse!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore a Variety of Themed Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a range of environments such as the woods, an abandoned mine, a forest, ancient ruins, and more. Each environment is divided into multiple stages with unique paths and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/environments.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat Massive Waves of Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the stages, you\u2019ll come face to face with relentless waves of enemies that will corner you, forcing you to defeat them all to advance. Use your arsenal, movement, and strategy to overcome your foes and keep moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/waves.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Devastating Weapons to Aid in the Carnage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a variety of weapons to assist in your zombie massacre, including a shotgun, submachine gun, grenade launcher, flamethrower, electric cannon, proximity mines, and more. Each weapon has its own strengths and weaknesses for different situations, so explore all possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/weapons.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purchase Upgrades for Yourself and Your Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies and breaking crates throughout the levels will grant you orbs, which can be used to purchase upgrades for Jacob and his weapons in the pause menu. Max health, reload speed, damage, and ammo capacity are some of the upgrades you can buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/upgrades.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test Your Skills Against Epic Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each environment, after completing all stages, you will face a boss. Boss fights will put your skills and reflexes to the test, so don\u2019t let your guard down when battling them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/bosses.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802870?t=1742079087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742079087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/72562adbdcfa4e172590743e6ad380baa9016a82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742079087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/72562adbdcfa4e172590743e6ad380baa9016a82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742079087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains stylized violence with blood, decapitations, dismemberment, deaths caused by firearms, explosions, electrocution, and incineration, applied exclusively to zombie enemies. The level of blood and dismembermen