?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purchase Upgrades for Yourself and Your Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies and breaking crates throughout the levels will grant you orbs, which can be used to purchase upgrades for Jacob and his weapons in the pause menu. Max health, reload speed, damage, and ammo capacity are some of the upgrades you can buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/upgrades.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test Your Skills Against Epic Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each environment, after completing all stages, you will face a boss. Boss fights will put your skills and reflexes to the test, so don\u2019t let your guard down when battling them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/bosses.gif?t=1742079087\" /></p>","developers":["Muriki Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/header.jpg?t=1742079087","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":2571